1547 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Amanitacap stand out as the short\054 stocky\054 and aggressive outliers among the Fungrown race\056 Easily identified by their large\054 bright red caps studded with white spots\054 they possess a naturally venomous physical composition that reflects their harsh nature\056 Unlike their more peaceful kin\054 the Amanitacap harbour a deep sense of inherent superiority over all other species and subraces\056 They are so confident in their dominance that they willingly embrace the term Sporite\054 turning a label meant as an insult into a title of pride for themselves\056\n\nIn combat and daily life\054 their deadliest trait is the poison circulating within their bodies\056 Amanitacap warriors routinely harvest this internal venom\054 draining it directly from their caps over several minutes to coat their blades before entering a fight\056 Immune to both poison damage and the poisoned condition themselves\054 they rely on these deadly coatings to enforce their will or eliminate threats\056 Their malicious nature and willingness to use treacherous tactics make them feared recluses who demand submission from anyone crossing their paths\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1548 0 R
     /Pg 912 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

