1549 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Dexterity Score increases by 1\056\nSize\056 Amanitacap usually grow to around 3 feet tall and weigh around 80 pounds\056 Your size is Small\056\nSpeed\056 Your base walking speed is 25 feet\056\nPoisonous\056 You have advantage on saving throws against poison\054 and you have resistance to poison damage\056\nInternal Poisons\056 Over the course of 1 minute\054 you can spend 1 Hit Die to coat a weapon with poison drawn directly from your cap\056 Upon completion\054 the weapon deals an additional 1d4 poison damage on a successful hit for 1 hour\056 You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Constitution modifier per long rest\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1550 0 R
     /Pg 912 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

