1553 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Armillacap\054 largest of all Fungrown\054 are known for their love of peace\054 quiet\054 and tranquility\056 Often seen in solitude or with a small group\054 they tend to live far longer and grow much wiser than their smaller counterparts\056 Travelers frequently find an Armillacap lounging in a sunny meadow or soaking under a gentle waterfall\056\n\nStanding between 5\0476\042 and 6\0470\042 tall\054 these gentle giants feature a large\054 nearly flat cap that doubles as a defensive shield when trouble arises\056 Many Fungrown colonies hire Armillacap as community guards\054 knowing their peaceful demeanor and calm presence help resolve dangerous situations without violence\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1554 0 R
     /Pg 912 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

