1564 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Dexterity Score increases by 1\056\nSize\056 Creminicap average between 2\0476\042 and 3\0476\042 tall and weigh around 100 lbs due to their thick composition\056 Your size is Small\056\nSpeed\056 Your base walking speed is 25 feet\056\nDiplomatic\056 Due to their overly friendly nature\054 Creminicap often know just the right words for nearly any situation\056 When speaking with someone that you have spent at least an hour with previously\054 you can grant yourself advantage on Charisma \050Persuasion\051 skill checks for 10 minutes so long as the target does not consider you hostile\056\nLayered Skin\056 Creminicap skin consists of many thin layers\054 each stacked upon one another\056 As an action\054 you may force the outermost layer of your skin to shed\054 ending either one disease or one condition afflicting you\056 The condition can be blinded\054 deafened\054 paralyzed\054 or poisoned\054 and you can use this ability even if one of those conditions would otherwise prevent you from doing so \050such as paralyzed\051\056 You can use this ability once per long rest\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1565 0 R
     /Pg 1540 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

