  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Dexterity Score increases by 1\056\nSize\056 Morelcap average 4\0476\042 tall and weigh around 80 lbs\056 Your size is Small\056\nSpeed\056 Your base walking speed is 30 feet\056 You have a swim speed of 30 feet\056\nTorpedo\056 When swimming\054 if you move 20 feet in a straight line underwater towards a creature before hitting it with a melee attack on the same turn\054 the attack does an additional 2d6 bludgeoning damage\056 This ability may be used once per turn\056\nWater\055Logged\056 You learn the Waterjet cantrip\056 Wisdom is your spellcasting ability for this spell\056)
