endobj

1578 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ability Scores\056 Your Wisdom Score increases by 2\nAge\056 The Fungrown reach maturity around 5 years old and live to be around 40 years old\056\nAlignment\056 Generally speaking\054 the Fungrown are a chaotic bunch with no good or evil tendencies\056 The Amanitacap are an exception\054 as they tend to lean more towards evil deeds and ideals\056\nSize\056 Fungrown sizes vary wildly between each sub\055race\056\nDarkvision\056 You can see in dim light within 60 feet of you as if it were bright light\054 and in darkness as if it were dim light\056 You cannot discern color in darkness\054 only shades of gray\056\nLanguages\056 You can speak\054 read\054 and write Sylvan\056 You can speak Common\054 though most Fungrown experience significant difficulty reading and writing Common\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1579 0 R
     /Pg 1542 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

